\f0\fs18 \cf0 Introducing "Oakton" shoe rack\
This is my first project since moving to NoVa, yay! Since moving here, we needed all sorts of furnitures so my partner enlisted me without consenting me, of course.\
But being a good partner means compromise so l tried my best.\
Heavily inspired by @encurtis bench and I think both my partner and our puppy were happy to see it. Do they know the intricacies of dovetails on a curve? I doubt it.\
