\cf0 Introducing "Tantalus" whiskey cabinet\
The hand-cut dovetail joints speak to the time and care that went into every corner, while the cove-cut front adds depth and texture that feels just right in hand.\
Finished it off with solid brass hinges for a timeless, subtle shine.\
Now it's the perfect home for good whiskey and even better moments\
\
==========================================================================================================\
Introducing "Sonoran" tissue box\
This is a collaboration between my friend @wendy.hilli and I. The carcass of the box is made from walnut using half blind dovetails, and the lid is quarter sawn white oak.\
The highlight is definitely the handmade tiles with different cactus and flower imprints & 4 . Because when we designed this, we wanted to incorporate themes of Arizona into the box.\
It's going to be quite a storytelling piece and probably will be passed down generations! Hands down one of my most unique projects!\
\
